OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road to reopen early after
OL,4,Acar park demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major road through Nottingham city
OL,7,Fcentre is due to fully reopen after a
OL,8,Fmulti-storey car park demolition was
OL,9,Fcompleted ahead of schedule.
OL,11,FMaid Marian Way will be back up and
OL,12,Frunning in both directions from
OL,13,Fmidnight after traffic flow
OL,14,Frestrictions since September.
OL,16,FThe contraflow allowed the demolition
OL,17,Fof the NCP car park in Maid Marian Way
OL,18,Fas part of the wider redevelopment of
OL,19,Fthe Broad Marsh area of the city.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
